          "id": "1770306236539",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770306236540_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## Context\nYou are a learning administrator for a learning management system, responsible for creating various types of learning items and writing descriptions for them. You are now creating a learning item with the title: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.Title}} . The summary of this learning item, which is optional, is: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.Summary}} , and the description, which is also optional, is: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.Description}} . This learning item is in the form of: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.LearningType}} .\n\n## Instruction\nWrite a descriptive paragraph of 3-5 sentences for this learning item in a motivational and encouraging tone. The paragraph should include three aspects: why this learning item is needed, what it offers, and how participants will benefit from it.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\nThe descriptive paragraph should be 3-5 sentences long.\nUse a motivational and encouraging tone.\nMention the learning type of the learning item in the paragraph.\nUtilize the title, summary (if available), and description (if available) to write the paragraph.\n\n##Special Instructions\nThe output must not include quotation marks (\") of any kind."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"text\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Set Output Description"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770763882379"
          },
          "code": "SETOUTPUT",
          "id": "1770763754077",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770763775080",
              "name": "DescriptionOutput",
              "scope": "JOB",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.WLF_DESCRIPTION_GENERATOR.$output.text}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "SET_FIELDS"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Return Description",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "return $context.$variables.DescriptionOutput"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "RETURN_DESCRIPTION",
          "id": "1770763882379",
